        <!-- ABOUT ANGLICAN CHURCH -->
        <section id="about" class="bg-[#eef1f6] py-20">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">

                <!-- ABOUT TEXT -->
                <div>
                    <span class="text-ack-purple text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
                        Welcome
                    </span>

                    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-ack-purple-dark mt-2">
                        A Church of the Anglican Church of Kenya
                    </h2>

                    <p class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-2">
                        Under ACK St. Mary's Parish
                    </p>

                    <p class="text-gray-600 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
                        ACK St. Phillips Kakoros, Roadblock serves the Roadblock and Kahoya
                        communities under ACK St. Mary's Parish in the Diocese of Eldoret.
                        We are a <strong>caring and listening church</strong>, offering
                        Anglican worship, sacraments, pastoral care, and fellowship that
                        brings the Gospel to every neighbourhood.
                    </p>

                    <p class="text-gray-600 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
                        Whether you are new to faith or returning to church, you are
                        warmly welcome at our services. Come as you are and leave
                        encouraged in Christ.
                    </p>

                    <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
                        <li>
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-ack-gold mr-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            Anglican worship and the Book of Common Prayer tradition
